    "description": "<p>The character sweeps a hand through the weave of events, touching a target to wrap their fate around her own. The player rolls (Wits + Larceny). Each extra success on the roll, up to the Sidereal's Essence in extra successes, steals from one of the target's specific dice pools: the target suffers a -1 internal penalty to that pool for the scene, and the Sidereal gains one bonus die in the same pool for the scene. The Sidereal cannot steal from the same pool more than once per use of this Charm. A Sidereal of Essence 4 or higher may extend the range of this Charm beyond touch for an additional mote and 1wp per use. This Charm is a Shaping attack that cannot be blocked or dodged.</p>",
